  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UPR INFO 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to utilise the Universal Periodic Review (UPR) to effectively implement human rights obligations and commitments at the national level, through building the capacity and facilitating cooperation between key national stakeholders. Target countries are: Democratic Republic of Congo, Guinea, C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, Madagascar, South Africa, Togo, Bangladesh, Cambodia, Georgia, Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Malaysia and Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
